  <!-- Elephant Tusk -->
  <!--原中文: '象牙刀', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'elephant tusk',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: elephant tusk-->
  <TM_ElephantTusk.label>象牙刀</TM_ElephantTusk.label>
  <!--原中文: '这种大象的长牙被做成了一把长刀，在近战中可以用来刺穿和砍伤。刀柄由皮革包裹，\n		并有一些抗衡力，以改善刀柄，且轻重量的刀片允许快速攻击。然而，低重量和较软的刀锋使它成为对付重甲对手的糟糕选择。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'This elephant tusk has been fashioned into a long knife useful in close combat for both piercing and slashing attacks. The hilt is wrapped in leather to and has a small counter-balance to improve handling, and the light weight of the blade allow for quick attacks. However, the low weight and softer blade make it a poor choice against a heavily armored opponent.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: This elephant tusk has been fashioned into a long knife useful in close combat for both piercing and slashing attacks. The hilt is wrapped in leather to and has a small counter-balance to improve handling, and the light weight of the blade allow for quick attacks. However, the low weight and softer blade make it a poor choice against a heavily armored opponent.-->
  <TM_ElephantTusk.description>这种大象的长牙被做成了一把长刀，在近战中可以用来刺穿和砍伤。刀柄由皮革包裹，\n		并有一些抗衡力，以改善刀柄，且轻重量的刀片允许快速攻击。然而，低重量和较软的刀锋使它成为对付重甲对手的糟糕选择。</TM_ElephantTusk.description>
  <!--原中文: '手柄', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'handle',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: handle-->
  <TM_ElephantTusk.tools.0.label>手柄</TM_ElephantTusk.tools.0.label>
  <!--原中文: '刀尖', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'point',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: point-->
  <TM_ElephantTusk.tools.1.label>刀尖</TM_ElephantTusk.tools.1.label>
  <!--原中文: '刀刃', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'edge',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: edge-->
  <TM_ElephantTusk.tools.2.label>刀刃</TM_ElephantTusk.tools.2.label>
  <!-- Elephant Bow -->
  <!--原中文: '象弓', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Elephant bow bolt',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Elephant bow bolt-->
  <Projectile_ElephantBow.label>象弓</Projectile_ElephantBow.label>
  <!--原中文: '象弓', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Elephant Bow',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Elephant Bow-->
  <TM_ElephantBow.label>象弓</TM_ElephantBow.label>
  <!--原中文: '象牙做成的弓。象牙是神圣的，为减少硬度和重量，通过浸泡在魔力伊特中软化。虽然操控难度稍大一些，象弓在射程和精度方面有了显著的提高。\n象弓上刻有微小的附魔，是许多经验丰富的猎人的首选武器。\n\n这种武器被附魔，并为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的收益：\n提升最大能量值: +5\n提升能量回复速度: +5%\n技能强度: +10%\n技能冷却缩减: -10%', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'A bow shaped from elephant tusks. The tusks are hallowed out to decrease rigidity and reduce weight and softened by soaking it in a magicyte compound that increases suppleness. The elephant bow offers significant improvements in range and accuracy for distant targets over the greatbow, though it is slightly more difficult to handle.
	
The elephant bow is engraved with minor enchantments and is a preferred weapon by many experienced rangers and hunters.

This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +5
Energy Regen: +5%
Damage Boost: +10%
Ability Cooldown: -10%',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: A bow shaped from elephant tusks. The tusks are hallowed out to decrease rigidity and reduce weight and softened by soaking it in a magicyte compound that increases suppleness. The elephant bow offers significant improvements in range and accuracy for distant targets over the greatbow, though it is slightly more difficult to handle.
	
The elephant bow is engraved with minor enchantments and is a preferred weapon by many experienced rangers and hunters.

This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +5
Energy Regen: +5%
Damage Boost: +10%
Ability Cooldown: -10%-->
  <TM_ElephantBow.description>象牙做成的弓。象牙是神圣的，为减少硬度和重量，通过浸泡在魔力伊特中软化。虽然操控难度稍大一些，象弓在射程和精度方面有了显著的提高。\n象弓上刻有微小的附魔，是许多经验丰富的猎人的首选武器。\n\n这种武器被附魔，并为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的收益：\n提升最大能量值: +5\n提升能量回复速度: +5%\n技能强度: +10%\n技能冷却缩减: -10%</TM_ElephantBow.description>
  <!--原中文: '射击', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'limb',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: limb-->
  <TM_ElephantBow.tools.0.label>射击</TM_ElephantBow.tools.0.label>
  <!--原中文: '撼地斧', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'thrumbo axe',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: thrumbo axe-->
  <TM_ThrumboAxe.label>撼地斧</TM_ThrumboAxe.label>
  <!--原中文: '一个由敲击兽角和魔法原石制成的握柄组合而成的斧子. 此握柄中存储着奥术能量并且会在撼地斧被挥舞时转化为物理力量, 其强大的力量甚至可以一击将数个敌人劈成两半. 此斧握柄上同样铭刻着神秘的符文来增强使用者的奥术能量。\n		\n这种武器被附魔，并为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的收益：\n提升最大能量值: +10\n技能强度: +20%\n技能抗性: +30%\n劈裂冲击', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'An axe crafted using thrumbo horns that are fused together with a clasp made from magicyte. This clasp stores arcane potential and transfers it as physical force when the axe is swung, allowing it to deliver mighty blows capable of cleaving through multiple opponents. The shaft is also etched with magical runes to augment the wielder's power.
		
This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +10
Damage Boost: +20%
Arcane Resistance: +30%
Cleaving Strike',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: An axe crafted using thrumbo horns that are fused together with a clasp made from magicyte. This clasp stores arcane potential and transfers it as physical force when the axe is swung, allowing it to deliver mighty blows capable of cleaving through multiple opponents. The shaft is also etched with magical runes to augment the wielder's power.
		
This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +10
Damage Boost: +20%
Arcane Resistance: +30%
Cleaving Strike-->
  <TM_ThrumboAxe.description>一个由敲击兽角和魔法原石制成的握柄组合而成的斧子. 此握柄中存储着奥术能量并且会在撼地斧被挥舞时转化为物理力量, 其强大的力量甚至可以一击将数个敌人劈成两半. 此斧握柄上同样铭刻着神秘的符文来增强使用者的奥术能量。\n		\n这种武器被附魔，并为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的收益：\n提升最大能量值: +10\n技能强度: +20%\n技能抗性: +30%\n劈裂冲击</TM_ThrumboAxe.description>
  <!--原中文: '手柄', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'handle',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: handle-->
  <TM_ThrumboAxe.tools.0.label>手柄</TM_ThrumboAxe.tools.0.label>
  <!--原中文: '劈砍', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'cleave',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: cleave-->
  <TM_ThrumboAxe.tools.1.label>劈砍</TM_ThrumboAxe.tools.1.label>
  <!--原中文: '角', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'horns',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: horns-->
  <TM_ThrumboAxe.tools.2.label>角</TM_ThrumboAxe.tools.2.label>
  <!-- Thrumbo Saber -->
  <!--原中文: '秘能刀', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'thrumbo saber',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: thrumbo saber-->
  <TM_ThrumboSaber.label>秘能刀</TM_ThrumboSaber.label>
  <!--原中文: '一把锋利的刀锋被注入了一些神秘的能量。让它比金属刀轻，它的刃可以穿透所有的盔甲，但某些厚的要死的盔甲除外。许多刀锋高手都喜欢这种武器，因为它是为了速度和杀伤力而设计的。进一步的附魔也可以让使用者加速，在短时间内使他们的攻击率翻倍。\n这件武器是附魔的，为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的收益：\n技能冷却时间: -10%\n伤害提升: +10%\n击中时急速 (25%)', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'A razor sharp blade forged from the horn of a thrumbo and infused with arcane energy. The thrumbo saber is lighter than metal blades and it's edge can cut through all but the thickest armor. Many masters of the blade favor this weapon as it is designed for speed and lethality. Further enchantments may also quicken the users, doubling their attack rate for a short period.
		
This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Ability Cooldown: -10%
Damage Boost: +10%
Haste on hit (25%)',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: A razor sharp blade forged from the horn of a thrumbo and infused with arcane energy. The thrumbo saber is lighter than metal blades and it's edge can cut through all but the thickest armor. Many masters of the blade favor this weapon as it is designed for speed and lethality. Further enchantments may also quicken the users, doubling their attack rate for a short period.
		
This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Ability Cooldown: -10%
Damage Boost: +10%
Haste on hit (25%)-->
  <TM_ThrumboSaber.description>一把锋利的刀锋被注入了一些神秘的能量。让它比金属刀轻，它的刃可以穿透所有的盔甲，但某些厚的要死的盔甲除外。许多刀锋高手都喜欢这种武器，因为它是为了速度和杀伤力而设计的。进一步的附魔也可以让使用者加速，在短时间内使他们的攻击率翻倍。\n这件武器是附魔的，为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的收益：\n技能冷却时间: -10%\n伤害提升: +10%\n击中时急速 (25%)</TM_ThrumboSaber.description>
  <!--原中文: '刀柄頂端', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'pommel',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: pommel-->
  <TM_ThrumboSaber.tools.0.label>刀柄頂端</TM_ThrumboSaber.tools.0.label>
  <!--原中文: '刺口', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'stab',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: stab-->
  <TM_ThrumboSaber.tools.1.label>刺口</TM_ThrumboSaber.tools.1.label>
  <!--原中文: '刀刃', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'edge',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: edge-->
  <TM_ThrumboSaber.tools.2.label>刀刃</TM_ThrumboSaber.tools.2.label>
  <!-- Glory Maul -->
  <!--原中文: '荣耀战锤', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Glory Maul',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Glory Maul-->
  <TM_GloryMaul.label>荣耀战锤</TM_GloryMaul.label>
  <!--原中文: '一种专为对抗各种敌人而设计的单手锤。 荣耀战锤的头部有一个钝的、锯齿状的末端，可以将打击的重量集中在几个点上，另一端与用来刺穿厚甲的弯曲的鹰爪尖相平衡。 荣耀之锤因其魔力而得名，它能赋予持用者强大的力量祝福。\n		\n这个武器是附魔的，并为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的增益: \n最大能量值: +20\n技能抗性: +20%\n技能强度: +10%\n命中时获得激励效果 (15%)', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'A one handed mace designed for effectiveness against a variety of foes. The head of the Glory Maul has a blunt, end shaped with a jagged formation to condense the weight of a blow to several points, and is balanced on the other end against a curved talon's spike used to puncture thick armor. The Glory Maul is so named for its enchantment, which can grant the wielder with a powerful blessing of might.
		
This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +20
Arcane Resistance: +20%
Damage Boost: +10%
Bestow Might on hit (15%)',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: A one handed mace designed for effectiveness against a variety of foes. The head of the Glory Maul has a blunt, end shaped with a jagged formation to condense the weight of a blow to several points, and is balanced on the other end against a curved talon's spike used to puncture thick armor. The Glory Maul is so named for its enchantment, which can grant the wielder with a powerful blessing of might.
		
This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +20
Arcane Resistance: +20%
Damage Boost: +10%
Bestow Might on hit (15%)-->
  <TM_GloryMaul.description>一种专为对抗各种敌人而设计的单手锤。 荣耀战锤的头部有一个钝的、锯齿状的末端，可以将打击的重量集中在几个点上，另一端与用来刺穿厚甲的弯曲的鹰爪尖相平衡。 荣耀之锤因其魔力而得名，它能赋予持用者强大的力量祝福。\n		\n这个武器是附魔的，并为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的增益: \n最大能量值: +20\n技能抗性: +20%\n技能强度: +10%\n命中时获得激励效果 (15%)</TM_GloryMaul.description>
  <!--原中文: '利爪尖刺', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'talon spike',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: talon spike-->
  <TM_GloryMaul.tools.0.label>利爪尖刺</TM_GloryMaul.tools.0.label>
  <!--原中文: '压碎', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'crush',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: crush-->
  <TM_GloryMaul.tools.1.label>压碎</TM_GloryMaul.tools.1.label>
  <!--未识别字段，谨慎删除-->
  <TM_GloryMaul.comps.CompEnchantedItem.enchantedAction.actionLabel>赋予力量</TM_GloryMaul.comps.CompEnchantedItem.enchantedAction.actionLabel>
  <!-- Decimation -->
  <!--原中文: '残杀重锤', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Decimation',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Decimation-->
  <TM_Decimation.label>残杀重锤</TM_Decimation.label>
  <!--原中文: '一种被施了如此重的魔法的双手重锤，挥舞后强大的质量撕裂任何企图阻挡它的材料。 它似乎是由一整块金属锻造而成，末端一个包裹着皮革的把手用于挥舞。 蚀刻精细的符文覆盖在锤身的表面，精致十足。 当握住它时，战士面临的第一个挑战就是它的重量，但出色的设计使得的整个巨锤的重心十分得当。 每次命中都有概率撕碎敌人的护甲，使其在随后的攻击中受到更多的伤害。\n		\n这个武器是附魔的，并为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的增益: \n最大能量值: +40\n技能抗性: +40%\n技能强度: +30%\n命中时使敌方破甲 (50%)', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'A two handed mace so heavily enchanted that it tears apart the cohesion of any material it strikes. It is forged seemingly from a single piece of metal and wielded from a handle wrapped in simple leather. Finely etched runes cover the surface of the mace, making it appear almost delicate. When held, the quality of the design is apparent, with perfect balance and solid handling despite the authoritative finality of its weight. Each blow has a chance to inflict frailty on the target, causing it to take more damage from subsequent attacks.
		
This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +40
Arcane Resistance: +40%
Damage Boost: +30%
Frailty on hit (50%)',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: A two handed mace so heavily enchanted that it tears apart the cohesion of any material it strikes. It is forged seemingly from a single piece of metal and wielded from a handle wrapped in simple leather. Finely etched runes cover the surface of the mace, making it appear almost delicate. When held, the quality of the design is apparent, with perfect balance and solid handling despite the authoritative finality of its weight. Each blow has a chance to inflict frailty on the target, causing it to take more damage from subsequent attacks.
		
This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +40
Arcane Resistance: +40%
Damage Boost: +30%
Frailty on hit (50%)-->
  <TM_Decimation.description>一种被施了如此重的魔法的双手重锤，挥舞后强大的质量撕裂任何企图阻挡它的材料。 它似乎是由一整块金属锻造而成，末端一个包裹着皮革的把手用于挥舞。 蚀刻精细的符文覆盖在锤身的表面，精致十足。 当握住它时，战士面临的第一个挑战就是它的重量，但出色的设计使得的整个巨锤的重心十分得当。 每次命中都有概率撕碎敌人的护甲，使其在随后的攻击中受到更多的伤害。\n		\n这个武器是附魔的，并为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的增益: \n最大能量值: +40\n技能抗性: +40%\n技能强度: +30%\n命中时使敌方破甲 (50%)</TM_Decimation.description>
  <!--原中文: '手柄', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'handle',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: handle-->
  <TM_Decimation.tools.0.label>手柄</TM_Decimation.tools.0.label>
  <!--原中文: '压碎', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'crush',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: crush-->
  <TM_Decimation.tools.1.label>压碎</TM_Decimation.tools.1.label>
  <!-- The rune blade -->
  <!--原中文: '云灵刀', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Ruunbled',更新于2026-02-14-->
